<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Length and area of the locus around a segment</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>[[if test="is(kx=0)"]]A straight hedge at a school in Kitui is \({@L@}\) m long. The ground within \({@d@}\) m of the hedge is to be weeded.[[elif test="is(kx=1)"]]A straight water pipe \({@L@}\) m long is buried at a farm near Kisumu. No tree may be planted within \({@d@}\) m of the pipe.[[else]]A straight boundary wall at a plot in Eldoret is \({@L@}\) m long. The ground within \({@d@}\) m of the wall, on both sides, is to be cemented. Treat the wall as a line.[[/if]]</p><p>Use the \(\pi\) key on your calculator and give answers correct to 1 decimal place.</p><p>(a) Find the length of the boundary of the region (the locus of points exactly \({@d@}\) m from the [[if test="is(kx=0)"]]hedge[[elif test="is(kx=1)"]]pipe[[else]]wall[[/if]]).</p><div>[[input:ans1]] m [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find the area of the region.</p><div>[[input:ans2]] \(\text{m}^2\) [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>The locus of points \({@d@}\) m from a segment of length \({@L@}\) m is two straight sides of length \({@L@}\) m, one on each side of the [[if test="is(kx=0)"]]hedge[[elif test="is(kx=1)"]]pipe[[else]]wall[[/if]], joined at each end by a semicircle of radius \({@d@}\) m. The two semicircles together make one circle.</p><p>(a) Length \(= 2 \times {@L@} + 2\pi \times {@d@} = {@dispdp(float(floor(10^1*(per)+1/2)/10^1),1)@}\) m.</p><p>(b) The region is a rectangle \({@L@}\) m by \({@2*d@}\) m and two half-discs of radius \({@d@}\) m: area \(= {@L@} \times {@2*d@} + \pi \times {@d@}^2 = {@dispdp(float(floor(10^1*(ar)+1/2)/10^1),1)@}\) \(\text{m}^2\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[/* Design: length and area of the locus around a segment. L 8 to 40 (even), d 1 to 5: on every (L, d) pair the diagnostics are more than 0.1002 apart. Source: original. */
kx: rand(3);
L: 8+2*rand(17);
d: 1+rand(5);
per: 2*L+2*%pi*d;
ar: 2*d*L+%pi*d^2;
/* (a) no ends; whole circles at the ends; one semicircle; one side */
p1: 2*L; p2: 2*L+4*%pi*d; p3: 2*L+%pi*d; p4: L+2*%pi*d;
/* (b) no ends; width d; two discs */
a1: 2*d*L; a2: d*L+%pi*d^2; a3: 2*d*L+2*%pi*d^2;]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
  <specificfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[]]></text></specificfeedback>
